// A lean worker writes the live log path.
// The open file is not cut. Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE live ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG live law

IMPULSE live 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "live" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
